+- **PLE reads are slow on this drive**: the engine's reader logs p50 4-6.5 ms and p99 11-14 ms per 4 KB read (an
+  NVMe SSD answers in ~0.05-0.2 ms), and a bigger row cache does not help (most reads are first-time rows).
